    "name": "Caffeinated RC Translation Drill",
    "text": "1\nCaffeinated RC Translation Drill\n1 PASSAGE\nInstructions\n\nRead, translate, and quip paragraph 1*. Do it just like LR.\n\nTake a few seconds to confirm your Translation with the paragraph you just read.\n\nIn this step, you are not rereading from scratch. \n\nYou're confirming the Translation you already have is right. \n\nThis style of confirming your Translation with the text applies to every confirmation you ever do on RC.\n\nRepeat this pattern for all remaining paragraphs.\n\nAt the end of the passage, confirm your Translation with the entire passage. This should take 15-30 seconds.\n\nOPTIONAL: Look away and recap the FULL TRANSLATION of the entire passage silently.\n\nThis step is optional, but you should do it when you first begin Caffeinated RC Translation Drills and periodically afterward, just to confirm that you can.\n\nComplete this same process on all remaining passages in the section.\n\nSEE FULL WORKOUT DETAILS",
