    "name": "HIIT (High Intensity Interval Training)",
    "text": "4\nHIIT (High Intensity Interval Training)\nInstructions\n\nNOTE: Do not attempt HIIT if you have never done a Thunderdome. Ideally, you've done several Thunderdomes and begun to feel confident while Thunderdoming before ever attempting HIIT.\n\nAfter you finish your Translation + CLIR on a given stimulus at 20-minute pace, complete the stimulus' Thunderdome without looking at the stimulus again*.\n\nCap each Thunderdome output at 30 seconds outloud.\n\nUse AI voice dictation to record your Thunderdome outputs while keeping the workout speedy. My favorite dictation software is Flow; it's free up to 2000 words per week.\n\nIf you go over 30 seconds per Thunderdome output, don't worry about it. Just aiming for 30 seconds will make you faster.\n\nSEE FULL WORKOUT DETAILS",
    "html": "<div data-slot=\"table-row\" role=\"row\" class=\"col-span-full overflow-hidden\" style=\"height: 378.167px; box-sizing: content-box; transform: none; margin-left: -1rem; margin-right: -1rem; margin-top: -0.25rem; background-color: var(--color-seafoam-lc); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0px var(--color-soft-black), 0px 0px 0 0 var(--color-soft-black), inset 0 0 0 4px var(--color-soft-black); z-index: 1; border-radius: 12px;\"><div class=\"grid self-start\" style=\"grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 100%); opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.15s;\"><div class=\"col-span-full p-1\"><div data-testid=\"schedule-expanded-card\" class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-xl bg-white\"><div class=\"\n          flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 pt-4 pb-3\n          md:px-6 md:pt-6 md:pb-4\n        \"><div class=\"\n            flex items-center gap-3\n            md:gap-5\n          \"><div class=\"inline-flex min-h-7 min-w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-soft-black px-1 text-caption-large font-black text-soft-black transition-shadow duration-300 bg-soft-white size-12 shrink-0 bg-chartreuse! text-body-m! font-extrabold!\" role=\"status\">4</div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5\"><h3 class=\"text-body-l font-bold text-soft-black\">HIIT (High Intensity Interval Training)</h3></div></div><button class=\"\n    inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-full\n    font-extrabold uppercase lh-outline\n    [transition:background-color_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),border-color_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),box-shadow_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),translate_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]\n    disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50\n   \n          border-black bg-soft-white text-black\n          hover:not-disabled:-translate-x-[3px]\n          hover:not-disabled:-translate-y-[3px] hover:not-disabled:bg-soft-white\n          hover:not-disabled:shadow-[3px_3px_0_0_#171712]\n          active:not-disabled:-translate-x-[1px]\n          active:not-disabled:-translate-y-[1px]\n          active:not-disabled:shadow-[1px_1px_0_0_#171712]\n         h-[38px] gap-2 text-caption-medium border-[2px] !size-9.5 !gap-0 !px-0 -translate-x-[3px] -translate-y-[3px] shadow-[3px_3px_0_0_#171712] \n          h-8! w-11.5! shrink-0!\n          group-hover/expandable:-translate-x-[3px]\n          group-hover/expandable:-translate-y-[3px]\n          group-hover/expandable:bg-soft-white\n          group-hover/expandable:shadow-[3px_3px_0_0_#171712]\n          group-has-[[data-no-expand]:hover]/expandable:translate-x-0!\n          group-has-[[data-no-expand]:hover]/expandable:translate-y-0!\n          group-has-[[data-no-expand]:hover]/expandable:shadow-none!\n          peer-hover/bookmark:translate-x-0! peer-hover/bookmark:translate-y-0!\n          peer-hover/bookmark:shadow-none!\n          hover:-translate-x-[3px] hover:-translate-y-[3px] hover:bg-soft-white\n          hover:shadow-[3px_3px_0_0_#171712]\n         \n            shrink-0 self-start\n            lg:h-11! lg:w-15.5\n          \" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close view\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform: rotate(180deg);\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-testid=\"lucide-chevron-down-icon\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></span></button></div><div class=\"\n          flex flex-col gap-2 px-4 pb-4\n          md:px-8 md:pb-6\n        \"><h4 class=\"text-body-l font-extrabold text-soft-black\">Instructions</h4><div class=\"prose text-body-s\"><p><strong>NOTE</strong>: <strong>Do not attempt HIIT if you have never done a Thunderdome.</strong> Ideally, you've done several Thunderdomes and begun to feel confident while Thunderdoming before ever attempting HIIT.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>After you finish your Translation + CLIR on a given stimulus at 20-minute pace, complete the stimulus' Thunderdome without looking at the stimulus again<span class=\"cursor-pointer \n                      cursor-help underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2\n                    \" data-state=\"closed\">*</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Cap each Thunderdome output at 30 seconds outloud.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Use AI voice dictation to record your Thunderdome outputs while keeping the workout speedy. My favorite dictation software is <a href=\"https://wisprflow.ai/students\" target=\"_blank\">Flow</a>; it's free up to 2000 words per week.</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>If you go over 30 seconds per Thunderdome output, don't worry about it. Just aiming for 30 seconds will make you faster.</p>\n</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"pt-2\"><a href=\"/workouts-and-routines/workouts/hiit-high-intensity-interval-training\"><button class=\"\n    inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-full\n    font-extrabold uppercase lh-outline\n    [transition:background-color_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),border-color_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),box-shadow_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),translate_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]\n    disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50\n   \n          border-black text-black\n          hover:not-disabled:-translate-x-[3px]\n          hover:not-disabled:-translate-y-[3px]\n          hover:not-disabled:shadow-[3px_3px_0_0_#171712]\n          active:not-disabled:-translate-x-[1px]\n          active:not-disabled:-translate-y-[1px]\n          active:not-disabled:shadow-[1px_1px_0_0_#171712]\n         h-[38px] gap-2 text-caption-medium border-[2px] pl-4 pr-3\">See full workout details<span class=\"flex items-center justify-center\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"12\" class=\"\" viewBox=\"0 0 26 19\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-t